@startuml seq-issue-csr
!theme plain
title UC1: Issue a certificate from a CSR (recommended path)
autonumber

actor "Developer / CI" as Dev
participant "openssl / keytool" as Tool
participant "zenv-cad\nRouter + Auth" as API
participant "AppState\n(spawn_blocking)" as St
participant "CertificateAuthority" as CA
participant "IssuancePolicy" as Pol
database "Store" as DB

Dev -> Tool : generate key pair + CSR locally
note right : private key never leaves\nthe requester's machine
Tool --> Dev : app.key, app.csr
Dev -> API : POST /api/v1/certificates\nAuthorization: Bearer zca_…\n{csr_pem, profile, validity_days}
API -> DB : authenticate(sha256(token))
alt token unknown / disabled
  API --> Dev : 401 problem+json
end
API -> St : blocking(issue)
St -> CA : issue_from_csr(request)
CA -> CA : parse CSR, verify its self-signature
CA -> Pol : resolve_validity(days)
CA -> Pol : check_names(SANs)\nsuffix match on label boundary,\nno wildcard unless allowed
alt policy violation
  CA --> API : CaError::Policy
  API --> Dev : 403 policy-violation
end
CA -> CA : build params from PROFILE only\n(KU, EKU, CA:FALSE, CRL DP,\n128-bit random serial, AKI)
CA -> CA : sign with intermediate key
CA --> St : IssuedCertificate
St -> DB : BEGIN; insert certificate;\naudit "certificate.issued"; COMMIT
St --> API : CertificateRecord
API --> Dev : 201 Created + Location\n{serial, not_after, cert_pem, …}
Dev -> API : GET /api/v1/certificates/{serial}/download?format=chain
API --> Dev : leaf + intermediate (PEM)
Dev -> Dev : deploy app.key + chain to the DMZ app
@enduml
